Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.67,0:00:09.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Going out again?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.88,0:00:12.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, we're going to Grandma's tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I know.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.29,0:00:15.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.63,0:00:20.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dad's alive, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.54,0:00:25.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,This again? Yes, he's alive, I told you already!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.17,0:00:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.29,0:00:28.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've only ever spoken to him through our lawyers.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.38,0:00:32.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I can tell you he pays his child support.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.54,0:00:35.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,So much that I thought about sending it back.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.00,0:00:36.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.54,0:00:40.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I was being stubborn about\Nit and didn't want to tell you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.92,0:00:42.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was young,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.42,0:00:45.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,and wanted to say\NI'd raised you all on my own,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.29,0:00:47.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I never touched the money.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.42,0:00:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I kept it all for you, of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.79,0:00:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought if you started to resent him,\NI'd step in and tell you about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.33,0:00:59.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,But you still love him, don't you?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.54,0:01:02.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You never stopped wearing\Nthat cute hairpin, after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.71,0:01:03.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.29,0:01:06.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.25,0:01:11.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y'know, Mom...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.33,0:01:15.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dad still draws manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.04,0:01:18.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really? Did you talk to him?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.92,0:01:21.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.75,0:01:24.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.88,0:01:27.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is he working on something he likes?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.54,0:01:33.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you see him, could you tell him something?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.33,0:01:39.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.50,0:03:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.46,0:03:19.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is crazy!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.33,0:03:21.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,My feed is literally nothing\Nbut the Angelic Airborne!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.13,0:03:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, damn!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.63,0:03:23.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, damn!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.63,0:03:23.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,They're so pretty!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.46,0:03:25.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't even begin to describe how this makes me feel.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.33,0:03:26.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't even begin to describe how this makes me feel.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.33,0:03:26.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Sensei, you gotta see this!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.17,0:03:27.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Sensei, you gotta see this!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.00,0:03:29.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's incredible.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.96,0:03:33.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel looks exactly like how\NTakamatsu-sensei draws her.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.67,0:03:37.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't be like that!\NLook, they've got an Ariel!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.50,0:03:40.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're right. She looks good, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.21,0:03:50.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei, your art! No!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.13,0:03:54.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-was her cosplay that good?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.83,0:03:57.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ten years. It's been ten whole years!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.21,0:03:59.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, it has to be her.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.79,0:04:02.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,She looks just like her\Nmother back when we first met.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.58,0:04:05.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, why?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.58,0:04:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mita-kun.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.38,0:04:13.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could I make it to Comiket in time from here?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.46,0:04:15.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, you want to actually go?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.54,0:04:18.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You could, but then we'll\Ndefinitely miss our deadline!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.17,0:04:20.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to go now,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.00,0:04:23.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,or I'll never be\Nthe man I should have been!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.50,0:04:27.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,How could I ever have chosen work over family?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.79,0:04:29.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What kind of man does that?!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.50,0:04:30.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I can't...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.92,0:04:32.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.04,0:04:35.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's up to us to get this inked!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.46,0:04:37.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was just getting bored of backgrounds, anyway.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.88,0:04:40.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dunno why you gotta jet, but go! We've got this.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.50,0:04:43.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We all know how to draw everything in your style.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.46,0:04:44.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come help, Mita!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.71,0:04:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go, Sensei! We'll manage this without you!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.83,0:04:47.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go, Sensei! We'll manage this without you!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.83,0:04:47.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.54,0:04:48.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go, Sensei! We'll manage this without you!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.67,0:04:50.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're taking a ten-minute break!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.04,0:04:53.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our crowd is sticking around!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.17,0:04:55.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah! What a difference from yesterday!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.38,0:04:58.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are you surprised? We rehearsed like crazy.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.63,0:05:11.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no way she knows I work on the manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.33,0:05:14.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It must be some kind of divine punishment,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.54,0:05:16.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,or miraculous coincidence...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.88,0:05:23.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where do I go now?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.71,0:05:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mita-kun?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.50,0:05:29.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei, they're on the roof!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.13,0:05:31.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go to the top of the West Exhibition Hall!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.83,0:05:33.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.50,0:05:39.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've been drawing shonen manga for a decade now.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.92,0:05:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Telling my readers, "be kind," "be a good example,"
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.00,0:05:49.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,but that all counts for nothing if\NI can't live up to those same ideals!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.42,0:05:52.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,So many people...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.21,0:05:57.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.13,0:06:01.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.96,0:06:02.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.83,0:06:05.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, all these people are here to see them?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.75,0:06:08.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,People are shouting the names\Nof characters I draw all the time.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.33,0:06:09.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.50,0:06:10.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikarin!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.17,0:06:11.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't have a Mikarin!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.79,0:06:13.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.25,0:06:30.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, Aria. Look how you've grown.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.25,0:06:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hate you, and I hate your stupid manga!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.08,0:06:39.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I lost myself in my work,\Nand broke my daughter's heart...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.50,0:06:44.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But manga was the only way I knew how to survive.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.42,0:06:48.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did my absence leave a permanent scar?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.63,0:06:53.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,She must hate me, and manga, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.38,0:07:00.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Manga hurt the people I loved the most,\Nyet I'm still choosing it over them.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.38,0:07:02.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm a monster.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.00,0:07:05.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ariel is so fun and energetic.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.13,0:07:08.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is she based on someone?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.04,0:07:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, no?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.96,0:07:12.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was a horrible person who'd never redeem himself.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.83,0:07:15.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yet there I was,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.29,0:07:20.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,writing stories about the most good,\Nmoral characters.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.42,0:07:23.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted people to live like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.50,0:07:26.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to live like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.17,0:07:29.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't care if that sentiment changed anyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.21,0:07:32.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.08,0:07:35.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't care.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.92,0:07:40.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.50,0:07:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no way she knows\NI'm the author of Side Story.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.83,0:07:46.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a coincidence.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.25,0:07:50.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I always wanted to know how she felt,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.08,0:07:54.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,but even if I had the courage to ask her now,\Nit would only end up hurting her again.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.79,0:07:58.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know she's a good kid.\NHer mother would've raised her well.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.25,0:08:00.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't assume this means she forgives you.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.96,0:08:04.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll never stop paying for my mistakes.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.67,0:08:06.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're taking a ten-minute break!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.67,0:08:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ink and calluses? Like a manga-ka?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.79,0:08:14.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, come on.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.79,0:08:17.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.88,0:08:19.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,How're you all feeling?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.00,0:08:21.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling great!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.21,0:08:22.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Want some water?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.79,0:08:26.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.08,0:08:30.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kisaki-sensei is here?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.42,0:08:32.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then I was right!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.38,0:08:33.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.75,0:08:35.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.42,0:08:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, where are you going? He went that way!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.79,0:08:41.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, can you buy us some time?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.08,0:08:42.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.88,0:08:45.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, is there time?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.21,0:08:51.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,We also made a VB Melia costume!\NAnd it's super high-quality!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.54,0:08:53.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,We want him to see it!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.67,0:08:55.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.08,0:09:00.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Higarashi-sensei!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.25,0:09:03.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes! Tomorrow's the deadline, I know!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.67,0:09:06.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, my editor's definitely not here, so...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.50,0:09:12.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do I know you?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.71,0:09:14.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do I know you?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.13,0:09:19.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm, uh... I'm a huge Liliel otaku!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.83,0:09:23.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can see that!\NThey only ever made ten of those hats!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.17,0:09:26.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,How did you know it was me?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.38,0:09:30.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I dunno, I...\NJust kinda guessed from your appearance?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.33,0:09:35.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.96,0:09:37.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could I get your autograph?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.88,0:09:39.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.63,0:09:40.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.88,0:09:46.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is rare merch.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.88,0:09:49.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not the real deal.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.29,0:09:51.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You should get Takamatsu-sensei's\Nautograph instead.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.75,0:09:54.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can get him to sign it for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.21,0:09:57.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I want your autograph, Higarashi-sensei.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.88,0:10:00.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't say you're not the real deal.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.17,0:10:04.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've been reading Side Story\Nreligiously for ten years.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.67,0:10:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right. Okay, then...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.92,0:10:12.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.33,0:10:16.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's nothing, really. Thank you for being a fan.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.17,0:10:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should get going. I've got a deadline to hit.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.25,0:10:23.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, uh...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.58,0:10:26.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hate to be that guy,\Nbut could you also draw something for me?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.08,0:10:27.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.08,0:10:31.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, sure, but... You really want me to?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.17,0:10:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, please!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.42,0:10:36.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm terrible at doing quick sketches...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.00,0:10:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let me start the eyes here, I guess?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.00,0:10:40.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,You can take your time, I don't mind!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.21,0:10:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, then I'll be extra careful.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.58,0:10:45.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Th-that's not what I meant, but sure!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.38,0:10:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.21,0:10:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll treasure this forever.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.04,0:10:54.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,He drew that so fast!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.42,0:10:58.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shit! He's so gonna hit me\Nwith the "if that's all" now!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.58,0:10:59.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.96,0:11:01.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,If that's all, then...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.79,0:11:03.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.71,0:11:05.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I also loved Valkyrie Battle!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.33,0:11:09.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, do people know that was me?!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.25,0:11:12.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I just had a hunch.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.38,0:11:14.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you just tricked me into confirming it...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.71,0:11:21.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you, though.\NI didn't think it had any fans.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.96,0:11:24.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,My first Jump magazine was\Nthe one with its debut,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.79,0:11:26.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,and I followed it religiously!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.42,0:11:31.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought it was so cool that Melia got\Nwings when she used her special attack!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.58,0:11:34.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought girls with wings were so hot!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.08,0:11:36.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,So y'know, when I finally got into\NThe Ashford Chronicles,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.88,0:11:40.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,that's probably why I fell so hard for Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.58,0:11:43.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.46,0:11:48.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have brought up the Ashford Chronicles!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.88,0:11:51.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I didn't mean it like that!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.42,0:11:53.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I-I should apologize.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.08,0:11:58.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That crap was a dark stain on my life.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.29,0:12:06.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hearing about the story or its\Ncharacters brings back all that trauma.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.25,0:12:08.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It still hurts.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.17,0:12:17.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know better than anyone how terrible it was,\Nbut it was all I could do back then.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.08,0:12:23.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,So please, I really wish you wouldn't\Ncall yourself a fan of that schlock.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.83,0:12:29.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I have to tell you this. I really am.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.38,0:12:34.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But please, I just want to forget it exists.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.38,0:12:40.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,How can he say that?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.42,0:12:44.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, I can't imagine how he must feel, but still...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.21,0:12:46.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's so wrong!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.33,0:12:50.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria is putting on her Melia costume!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.96,0:12:54.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,If she shows up now, it'll be a disaster!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.21,0:12:59.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should I stop her? No, that'd be worse!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.54,0:13:06.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa, Aria, I'm sorry...\NThis isn't about buying time anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.58,0:13:09.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is about my story now!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.75,0:13:11.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.00,0:13:18.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't call it crap.\NYou have no right to badmouth your work.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.08,0:13:23.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kids aren't their parents' property.\NYour work doesn't belong to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.92,0:13:27.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It doesn't belong to us readers, either.\NIt's a world of its own!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.71,0:13:33.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,No one can tell anyone\Nhow to feel about something.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.92,0:13:37.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,And no matter what you say about it, Sensei,\NI will always love that manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.63,0:13:42.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if you want to forget it, I won't!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.08,0:13:47.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura-kun? Is that you?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.67,0:13:51.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why is it schlock?\NBecause it had haters?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.38,0:13:53.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Name a single manga without haters! Go on!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.17,0:13:57.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,What makes you a fake?\NBecause you work on the spin-off?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.21,0:14:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you think those cosplays were fake,\Nthen, because they weren't the 'real deal'?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.25,0:14:05.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I'd never...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.17,0:14:07.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fine, you want me to spell it out for you, then?!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.46,0:14:10.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't give a shit about what the author thinks!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.29,0:14:12.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You want facts?! I'll hit you with the facts!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.54,0:14:19.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Back then, I loved him with my whole heart.\NThat fact will never change.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.46,0:14:27.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,The manga you made,\Nthe manga you created, made me happy!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.38,0:14:31.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you're the author,\Nyou can't change the fact that it changed my life!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.50,0:14:42.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,For ten years, I've lived in absolute misery.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.54,0:14:44.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's getting cancelled, Kisaki-sensei.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.63,0:14:46.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Try and wrap it up in five chapters.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.92,0:14:50.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll bundle it into two volumes, so we'll need...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.17,0:14:56.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was so relieved.\NI knew I couldn't keep going with it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.75,0:14:59.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,One day, I'm gonna make her the\Nmain character of her own story!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.75,0:15:01.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll get to read it first!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.83,0:15:03.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, honey.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.08,0:15:08.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I loved drawing Melia. I loved her so much.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.50,0:15:17.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I always wished I'd never created her.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.29,0:15:21.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, no parent ever wishes their\Ndaughter had never been born.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.67,0:15:23.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never could have imagined...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.38,0:15:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,...that Melia was bringing\Nsomeone out there so much happiness.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.79,0:15:36.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,No... I pretended it was impossible.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.21,0:15:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew there were people who said they loved it,\Nbut I couldn't bring myself to believe it.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.54,0:15:48.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted my manga in Weekly Shonen Jump,\Nwanted it to reach the hearts of a million readers.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.67,0:15:53.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't make one person happy.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.29,0:15:57.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I couldn't fathom how incredible that would be.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.63,0:16:00.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Aria.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.96,0:16:08.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for prioritizing the feelings of\Na million readers over your happiness.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.42,0:16:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Melia.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.00,0:16:15.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your heart was far more righteous than mine.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.29,0:16:18.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should never have despised you.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.58,0:16:23.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You, too, were my beloved daughter.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.29,0:16:28.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I beg of you, please, forgive me. Please.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.17,0:16:31.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.13,0:16:47.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,M-Melia...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.42,0:16:52.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.83,0:16:56.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-why?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.75,0:17:01.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can't you tell? Isn't it obvious how I feel?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.46,0:17:04.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.13,0:17:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.29,0:17:15.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura said most of what I wanted to say.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.00,0:17:19.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can we be good now?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.75,0:17:24.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know it's been ten years.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.63,0:17:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.33,0:17:31.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,My hands are so dirty, though.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.42,0:17:34.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I won't yell at you.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.96,0:17:37.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mom's the only one who had to\Ndeal with my rebellious phase.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.21,0:17:40.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.83,0:17:43.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could you stop apologizing?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.46,0:17:46.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kids get mad at their parents for\Nignoring them, or nagging them,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.54,0:17:49.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,or fighting with them,\Nor disappearing on them...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.79,0:17:53.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, we might even say we hate them.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.92,0:17:57.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,But do you think any kid really\Nwants to hate their mom or dad?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.21,0:18:03.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm your daughter. I know how Melia must feel.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.04,0:18:06.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why we're both here right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.88,0:18:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Listen close, because we're only\Ngoing to say this once, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.88,0:18:22.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you for bringing me into this world.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.38,0:18:34.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who should be thanking you.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.83,0:18:37.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria, Melia...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.79,0:18:42.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming into this world.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.21,0:18:44.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.63,0:18:49.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd get to meet you in real life.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.50,0:18:52.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It took ten years...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.04,0:18:57.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, today is finally a good day.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.17,0:19:03.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Side Story has given so much\Nmore character development to Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.79,0:19:04.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.33,0:19:07.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just by having her go from side to main character,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.71,0:19:09.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,she now has to be the one dealing with conflict
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.75,0:19:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,and overcoming her own obstacles!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.75,0:19:11.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,Do you want to talk to your Dad?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.67,0:19:12.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Do you want to talk to your Dad?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.25,0:19:16.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Honestly? I don't know what I'd say.\NI'm kinda glad Ririsa is doing her thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.42,0:19:19.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,How does she have more to say\Nto him than his literal daughter?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.54,0:19:22.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,He might be Aria's dad,\Nbut to Ririsa and I, he's a god.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.54,0:19:25.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here you all go.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.08,0:19:27.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.71,0:19:30.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I brought shikishi boards\Njust in case we ran into him!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.79,0:19:31.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're a genius!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.04,0:19:34.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should be thanking you.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.79,0:19:39.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you for cosplaying from Liliel: Side Story.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.46,0:19:44.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to have met passionate fans like you.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.17,0:19:48.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Which makes this next part hard to tell you.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.29,0:19:52.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel: Side Story is due to end soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.88,0:19:55.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! It's getting canceled? But it got an anime!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.75,0:19:57.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it not selling well?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.67,0:20:00.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's selling, but it's not growing.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.92,0:20:05.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not losing money,\Nbut it's been going on for a while,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.13,0:20:08.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,so the Editorial team said\NI can end it whenever I want.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.71,0:20:11.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you're thinking about ending the story?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.38,0:20:14.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you sure you should be telling us all this?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.96,0:20:17.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, because I've decided not to end it.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.54,0:20:24.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was hard to stay passionate about the\Nseries when it was all about the stale sales.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.75,0:20:29.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,But today, I got to see the joy on the faces\Nof people who read and buy the manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.67,0:20:32.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got to keep going, if only for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.38,0:20:33.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, so...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.29,0:20:37.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Editorial won't get on my case\Nif the sales are still okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.25,0:20:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what I can do to improve them, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.92,0:20:42.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You still won't look at them?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.75,0:20:47.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's Takamatsu-sensei's work.\NI'm just the fake replacement.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.04,0:20:52.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel: Side Story is my manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.83,0:20:55.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It'll end if I stop working on it.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.38,0:21:00.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,They said I can end it whenever I want.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.29,0:21:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Might as well keep going\Nuntil they decide to fire me.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.96,0:21:04.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can promise you that.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.38,0:21:08.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's thanks to you that I discovered this joy again.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.13,0:21:13.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You and your wonderful Airborne Squadron cosplays.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.63,0:21:18.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you've rescued me a second time, Okumura-kun.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.25,0:21:19.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.38,0:21:27.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's nothing special. It's just what otaku do.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.38,0:21:31.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should get going.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.83,0:21:38.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tonight's my deadline.\NIf I miss it, they might actually fire me.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.21,0:21:39.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, yikes!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.46,0:21:41.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then please, hurry back!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.50,0:21:44.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, Aria...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.46,0:21:45.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.54,0:21:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're still wearing that hairpin.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.58,0:21:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You remember it?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.88,0:21:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course I do. It's special.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.96,0:21:58.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I remember why your mother bought it, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.42,0:22:01.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I look just like Melia!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.04,0:22:05.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I saw it at the store and knew it\Nwould make you and Daddy happy.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.54,0:22:08.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Daddy won't come out of his office.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.92,0:22:11.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're fighting.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.96,0:22:15.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I totally forgot about it while I was at the store.\NI'm so silly.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.83,0:22:20.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Daddy says he wants to talk!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.58,0:22:21.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.67,0:22:23.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.46,0:22:27.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I always took special care of it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.63,0:22:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I always wore it, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.71,0:22:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's the hairpin that brought\Nyou and Mom back together.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.13,0:22:43.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.50,0:22:44.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, Dad.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.71,0:22:47.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mom wanted me to tell you something.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.54,0:22:48.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,She did?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.04,0:22:51.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whatcha drawing?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.33,0:22:55.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I, uh...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.83,0:22:58.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn, that's so good!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.00,0:22:59.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,It is?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.42,0:23:01.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Has no one told you?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.46,0:23:04.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I haven't shown this to anyone yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.25,0:23:07.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That makes me your first reader!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.46,0:23:10.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Makes me special, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.25,0:23:22.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,What did she say?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.42,0:23:25.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, I don't really understand what it meant, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.42,0:23:30.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Promise me I'll be the first reader on your next manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.08,0:23:36.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.83,0:23:43.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was happy then, and happy now.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:43.50,0:23:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Back then, I loved him with my whole heart.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:47.38,0:23:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,That fact will never change.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:52.88,0:23:54.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I promise.
